1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
You've tried 15 different events
this year.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:06,500
How many did you try twice?

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:11,000
Novelty is a treadmill: every night starts at stranger-zero.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Repetition compounds: same room, same faces,
familiarity doing the work.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,500
The psychology is boring and real: we like people we've seen before.

6
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:24,000
Pick one thing.
Go three times.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,500
Link in bio.
